---
// The CO₂ tool's plan, set as a reference table. Shared by the home page and the entry page.
---

<table class="reference">
  <caption>What it will do</caption>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <th scope="row"><span>Reads</span></th>
      <td>Your ChatGPT and Claude.ai data exports, Cursor's usage CSV, and Claude Code's local logs</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th scope="row"><span>Shows</span></th>
      <td>Tokens by model and type, and CO₂ as a low, middle and high estimate</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th scope="row"><span>Explains</span></th>
      <td>Every assumption with its source, which you can adjust</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th scope="row"><span>Suggests</span></th>
      <td>Ways to cut your footprint first, then where to offset the rest</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th scope="row"><span>Runs</span></th>
      <td>Entirely in your browser. Your files are never uploaded.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th scope="row"><span>Licence</span></th>
      <td>Free and open source (MIT)</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<style>
  .reference {
    align-self: start;
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    border-top: 3px solid var(--ink);
  }

  .reference caption {
    caption-side: top;
    text-align: left;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    font-weight: 650;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .reference th,
  .reference td {
    padding: 0.7rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);
    text-align: left;
    vertical-align: baseline;
  }

  .reference th {
    width: 10.5rem;
    padding-right: var(--space-s);
    font-weight: 400;
  }


  .reference th span {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.4em;
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    font-weight: 650;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding-top: 0.15em;
  }

  .reference th span::after {
    content: '';
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 2px dotted currentColor;
  }

  @media (max-width: 34rem) {
    .reference th {
      width: 7.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
